      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PostPilot – Publish\nPublishes one approved post, now or at a chosen time.\n- **Mock mode**: no social network is called; we create a fake post ID and link.\n- **Facebook**: Graph API photo post. Facebook schedules natively (10 min – 30 days ahead).\n- **LinkedIn**: no simple native scheduling, so a **Wait** node pauses until the chosen time, then posts.",
        "width": 760,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
